## **  MENU.INC.BANKED.BL -- the menu store's banked groups. #INCLUDE it
## **  straight before MENU.INC.BL. The bar's 16 rows, then the popup's 32,
## **  then, in the text group only, the dropdown pool's 64. Add SPC lines to
## **  match when a .MAX define grows.
## **
## ***********************************************************************
## A group must be declared before GP.BSTR names it, so this comes first.
